们是在监督我吗？这么晚都不睡🥺\n他准备洗完澡了。等会再上来看看。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1867255848143401075"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2024-12-12T17:05:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1867254398021513293"],"id":"1867254398021513293","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":222053,"like_count":137,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":25,"retweet_count":0},"text":"想不到吧我也有空降的一天\n#港女 #hksex https://t.co/2Pmiop3U7e","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1867254398021513293"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2024-12-12T15:46:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1867234484795707784"],"id":"1867234484795707784","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":83774,"like_count":89,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":29,"retweet_count":0},"text":"现在去太子做爱。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1867234484795707784"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2024-12-12T10:27:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1867154209113772402"],"id":"1867154209113772402","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":42403,"like_count":33,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"text":"好啦，我今天终于在7:00前下班啦～～～","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1867154209113772402"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2024-12-12T03:23:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1867047720399372755"],"id":"1867047720399372755","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":76525,"like_count":90,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":0},"text":"夫妻抚触的体验用前夫的话来说，就是变种的双飞😂，因为不能跟抚触师做爱。她会通过各种方式来挑起你的情欲，把前夫的那啥弄得很肿大，但是艾草的不是抚触师而是我🥹。虽然我也挺舒服的，但是没有视觉冲击，还是有点意兴阑珊。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1867047720399372755"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2024-12-12T03:02:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1867042252918493442"],"id":"1867042252918493442","in_reply_to_user_id":"1534571629061492736","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":35975,"like_count":25,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1867039198584377401","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"女主挺漂亮的，有点御姐也有点文艺，没有笑脸相迎，说话慢条斯理的，是前夫喜欢的类型🙄。我在视频号说刷到过她的视频，但要报名参加体验，还是得朋友推荐。她的视频号不温不火的，除此没有做任何营销。用她的话来说，她不做流量，只针对高端客户，所以私密性是关键。这番话倒深得我心。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1867042252918493442"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2024-12-12T02:50:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1867039198584377401"],"id":"1867039198584377401","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":72744,"like_count":48,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"text":"昨天说的夫妻抚触疗愈体验店，原来就在昨天爆炸的深圳湾华润悦府二期的楼下。抚触疗愈是一个近两年的新词，主打一个亲密接触+心理按摩，可以说准确地踩到了经济下行的痛点。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1867039198584377401"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2024-12-11T12:11:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1866818001758195742"],"id":"1866818001758195742","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":68929,"like_count":61,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":2},"text":"今天爆炸的深圳湾悦府二期，是今年年初我跟前夫去体验夫妻抚触与心灵按摩的地方😂😂😂。。。号称均价20万的深圳顶级豪宅盘，但基本没有家庭自住，基本是用来出租的。我印象中，那里的停车场是与商场混用的，非常杂乱。还没有正式的小区大门，根本没有豪宅的体验。不爆炸才怪呢。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1866818001758195742"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2024-12-11T04:33:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1866702896626290738"],"id":"1866702896626290738","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":66211,"like_count":74,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"同事离职，中午跟她来简单吃个farewell lunch\n那句话怎么说来着？\n当你的上班搭子突然离职\n不亚于断崖式的分手💔 https://t.co/VhX93jj9IF","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1866702896626290738"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2024-12-10T13:53:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1866481247066956109"],"id":"1866481247066956109","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":63757,"like_count":82,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":0},"text":"每次来推特刷到落魄的前夫，其实内心都不好受。世间的一切都是环环相扣，一切皆因果。不过，我觉得他还不是最惨的，毕竟享受过快乐的时光，像现在跟我吃饭的闺蜜，她对人生所有精心的规划，都抵不过命运的一次不怀好意的安排。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1866481247066956109"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2024-12-10T13:29:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1866475300647039047"],"id":"1866475300647039047","in_reply_to_user_id":"1534571629061492736","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":24165,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1866475213002866837","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"🇭🇰","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1866475300647039047"}],"includes":{"tweets":[{"author_id":"1702235657316253696","created_at":"2024-12-17T01:07:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1868825256326316087"],"id":"1868825256326316087","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":85846,"like_count":16,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":0},"text":"一对推上的夫妻，玩了四五年，粉丝十多万，拍视频收门槛好几年都没啥事。前几天无意间关注了李老师，没有评论啥也没有，然后国安上门了🥲🥲"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2024-12-12T17:05:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1867254398021513293"],"id":"1867254398021513293","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":222053,"like_count":137,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":25,"retweet_count":0},"text":"想不到吧我也有空降的一天\n#港女 #hksex https://t.co/2Pmiop3U7e"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2024-12-12T02:50:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1867039198584377401"],"id":"1867039198584377401","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":72744,"like_count":48,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"text":"昨天说的夫妻抚触疗愈体验店，原来就在昨天爆炸的深圳湾华润悦府二期的楼下。抚触疗愈是一个近两年的新词，主打一个亲密接触+心理按摩，可以说准确地踩到了经济下行的痛点。"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2024-12-10T13:29:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1866475213002866837"],"id":"1866475213002866837","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":59651,"like_count":78,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":0},"text":"下班跟闺蜜去野啦，就是胃还有点不舒服 https://t.co/p3Xd41Xe5A"}],"users":[{"id":"1534571629061492